wh40k-footfall-medical-marker-desc = Saved medical-scene source. Rotate the arrow to set facing; place seated actors on their intended chair's tile, with no exact centre alignment required.
wh40k-footfall-medical-ask-services = Available services.
wh40k-footfall-medical-small-talk = How is the shift going?
wh40k-footfall-medical-adrianvey-intro = Come closer. You can tell me it is only a scratch; the scanner usually has a second opinion.
wh40k-footfall-medical-adrianvey-menu = An examination costs nothing. I will name the treatment price before touching your account.
wh40k-footfall-medical-adrianvey-info = Fifty credits for treatment, plus four per point of injury. I treat existing injuries, stop bleeding and restore blood volume. One paid treatment every ten minutes, across all our desks. Missing limbs and persistent illnesses need separate care.
wh40k-footfall-medical-adrianvey-banter = Today someone asked whether the ten-minute interval meant they were safe for ten minutes. I admire the optimism, but that is not a warranty.
wh40k-footfall-medical-adrianvey-farewell = Take care. If you must be a regular, make it for conversation.
wh40k-footfall-medical-mirafenn-title = Mira Fenn — medical supplies
wh40k-footfall-medical-mirafenn-intro = Dressings, ointment and medicines. Nothing here needs a dramatic speech before opening it; reading the label will do.
wh40k-footfall-medical-mirafenn-menu = Tell me what you need. Buying a canister because it matches your coat is not a treatment plan.
wh40k-footfall-medical-mirafenn-info = Separate supplies, not ready-made medical kits: dressings for bleeding, ointment for burns, bruise packs, blood packs, tourniquets and a small medicine shelf. There is a scanner too. For serious injuries, see Adrian or the ward staff.
wh40k-footfall-medical-mirafenn-banter = Someone returned an empty ointment jar because the pain came back. I suggested returning the hazard they had walked into again.
wh40k-footfall-medical-mirafenn-farewell = Keep the dressings clean. The receipt is not sterile, however convincing the print may look.
